onPCtO71aglwpWzEliLSCrQxoWe7siUrSq-ha9hn5yA&oe=6AFDC96B"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1118055436385894", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569436_1118055439719227_2664889938767113566_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EBvS8NjjKGgQ7kNvwE0apMP&_nc_oc=AdpNAeU5Pa-cN8J7ui0OfAIfaFTddQlJNkIf357m2BRH1yp2tXGOlD9eR9oKinHINqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSNLLmKHYr5pRd8OKuVrxzZHJkbIzgEnz9MdI7e3vEMWg&oe=6AFDBFD6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1326219965229827", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75608434_1326219968563160_1443258879245188411_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b9B87GE13IkQ7kNvwHVh_cV&_nc_oc=AdpVrN7VOe0fLA5_sk1ZAYrEGSgQ1Vz21RRxEy6EnjphpUiHgyaYOUXi9CAWbAZhGPg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUQ3qch7PPA2_ijWMNyRkZ2UNBw3CrNfSlxpyOlnEE6g&oe=6AFDB859"}, "display_name": "Sortik Systems", "keywords": ["puzzle", "logic", "reflexes", "arcade", "control"], "long_description": "# In Sortik Systems, order is everything.  \n**Your task is simple: classify objects.**\n\nStep into **Sortik Systems**, an immersive **mixed reality** experience that will test your ability to classify objects with **precision** and **swiftness**. Here, there\u2019s no room for chaos.\n\n**Two game modes to challenge you:**\n\n- **Story Mode**  \nTake on the challenge of a narrative adventure lasting approximately **1 hour**, where you\u2019ll take on your new role at **Sortik Systems**. Your task seems simple: place each object in its rightful place and contribute to the perfection of order.  \nBut what if this perfect system hides dark intentions? Discover the truth behind **Sortik Systems**.\n\n \n- **Free Mode**  \nDo you have what it takes to be the best? In **Free Mode**, hone your skills and beat your own **records**. Here, **efficiency** and **accuracy** are key to proving your worth.\n\n\n**Sortik Systems is more than just a game.**  \nIt\u2019s an experience that reflects on **control**, **order**, and **perfection**.\n\n\n**Early Access**\n\nThis game is launching in Early Access to gather your feedback and continue developing new levels and improvements, such as an optimized level selector in Free Mode.\n\n**Are you ready to prove your worth in a system that tolerates no mistakes?**\n\n\nYour feedback matters! If you have any suggestions or comments, feel free to get in touch.  \nThank you for being part of the evolution of **Sortik Systems**.\n\n\u2013 Alex Pamp\n", "short_description": "In Sortik Systems, order is everything.  \nYour task is simple: classify objects.\n\nStep into Sortik Systems, an immersive experience that challenges your ability to classify objects with precision and swiftness. In this world, there is no room for chaos.\n\n- Story Mode  \nExperience an intense 1-hour journey, approximately. \n\n- Free Mode\nFor those who enjoy competition.\n\nAre you ready to prove yourself in a system that tolerates no mistakes?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://games.pamp.es/sortik-systems/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pamp Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://games.pamp.es/sortik-systems/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", 